    seoTitle: "Best Image Format for Websites in 2025: PNG, JPG, WebP, AVIF, SVG",
    metaDescription: "The definitive guide to choosing the right image format for your website. Covers WebP, AVIF, PNG, JPG, SVG, and GIF — with a decision guide for every use case.",
    h1: "Best Image Format for Websites in 2025: The Complete Decision Guide",
